send(screen,text,x,y,font) = creates the text (text) at (x,y) with (font) on (screen)
"text" or 'text' not "text' or 'text"
rem(text) = removes the text on each place on the screen it is writen.
getlib lib = {import lib}
for = for
if = if
while = while
def = code{}
connect(port) = connects to (network,port)
sen(text, port, ip/url) = sends (text) to (ip/url) with connection (port
ev(event) = waits for event to happen
|->(code) = waits for (code) ro run
|->(rec(port,text)) = waits for (port) to receive optional (text). if no (text) is provided, anything will trigger
|->(press(element)) = waits for (element) to be pressed
|->(touch(element)) waits for element to be touched with mouse
'->(other) = anything else
px(x,y,rgb) colors pixel (x,y) whith (rgb) color
pxs(x,y,x,y,rgb) colors pixels (x,y) to (x,y) whith (rgb) color
